[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909445313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116362#issuecomment-3909445313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116362","id":3909445313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pBWbB","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T16:31:36Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T16:33:30Z","body":"Which runtimes have you tested this on? And, has this led to a change in which format is selected on any of them?\r\n\r\nThe main thing I'm worried about is this change leading to a non-sRGB format getting selected, when an sRGB format is available. I don't remember the details, but I recall we had issues on some runtime(s) that were solved by prioritizing using an sRGB format.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909445313/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921213651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116362#issuecomment-3921213651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116362","id":3921213651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7puPjT","user":{"login":"eritschlSC","id":237798375,"node_id":"U_kgDODiyD5w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237798375?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC","html_url":"https://github.com/eritschlSC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T14:40:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T14:40:42Z","body":"@dsnopek We are experimenting with running Godot with an in-development proprietary OpenXR runtime. sRGB swapchain formats currently trigger a slow code path in that runtime. The only way to communicate this to the application according to the OpenXR specification is via the order of the formats returned by `xrEnumerateSwapchainFormats`, which Godot currently ignores. With this PR the format we support best is selected. Ideally other runtimes should also adjust the order of their swapchain formats by priority. If they don't and this PR would lead to breaking behavior in common setups then let's hold off on merging it until those are resolved. 🙂","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921213651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921527941","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116362#issuecomment-3921527941","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116362","id":3921527941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pvcSF","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T15:38:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T15:38:02Z","body":"I dug up some of the old issues around this, and it appears the main reason we want to favor sRGB formats is because on Meta Quest headsets when using OpenGL, if we don't use an sRGB format, then it'll double convert the colors to sRGB and they appear washed out.\r\n\r\nThe main issue is https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74857 but these also provide some background:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/71224\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/71708\r\n\r\nLooking back on those, it seems like every change we've made to the list of formats or their order has led to us breaking one of Pico 4, Steam VR or Meta Quest. :-) At the moment, we have a list and order that is working for all of those.\r\n\r\nSo, I'm a little wary of changing this without doing testing on as many runtimes as possible, with both Vulkan and OpenGL. Given that most Godot VR games use OpenGL and target Meta Quest, we absolutely can't bring back the bug with incorrect colors in that case (but we certainly shouldn't break any of the other platforms either, if we can help it)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921527941/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921636398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116362#issuecomment-3921636398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116362","id":3921636398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pv2wu","user":{"login":"eritschlSC","id":237798375,"node_id":"U_kgDODiyD5w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237798375?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC","html_url":"https://github.com/eritschlSC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eritschlSC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T15:56:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T15:56:23Z","body":"Thanks for the context! Yeah it really looks like messing with Godot's format priority list is a bad idea. Closing the PR for now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921636398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]